      en: ["The fort was originally reinforced in 1780 for border security.", "It controlled access to the fertile valley of the Artibonite River.", "In 1802, the fort withstood a two-week siege.", "The walls reach a thickness of two meters in some places.", "It featured an underground system for rainwater storage.", "The fort was abandoned as a military outpost after 1820."],
